<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>抱怨 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%8A%B1%E6%80%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 抱怨 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%8A%B1%E6%80%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>道歉与抱怨</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/social/apologizing-and-complaining/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/social/apologizing-and-complaining/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇拆成五个细化场景：&lt;strong&gt;约饭迟到&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;弄坏借来的充电器&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;室友半夜打游戏太吵&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;餐厅等了四十分钟没上菜&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;朋友道歉了我怎么接&lt;/strong&gt;。人物是同一个小圈子：室友兼朋友 Marcus、被你弄坏东西的 Nina、餐厅服务员 Kayla。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>